      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-63147",
      ":question/problem": "The following frequency table shows the distribution of the number of points scored by every player of a basketball team in their last game. How many players from the team played in the last game?\n\n| Number of Points Scored | Frequency |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $1 - 6$ | $4$ |\n| $7 - 12$ | $7$ |\n| $13 - 18$ | $3$ |\n| $19 - 24$ | $1$ |"
